TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Şu hazırladığım {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}zaman kapsülüne {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
baksana.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Şimdi tek yapmam gereken onu
toprağa gömmek{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Ama kendim gömersem,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
dayanamayıp hemen geri çıkaracağımı biliyorum!
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Aa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} kafama şimşek çaktı!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Belki
benim için
sen gömersin!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ne
dersin, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Olur!
Yapamam!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}He hecho una {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}cápsula del tiempo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
con mi posesión más preciada
dentro.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Ahora me falta enterrarla!
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Despedirme de mis cosas es
más duro de lo que creía{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}¡Ay!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Me dan ganas de llorar.
Creo que no puedo. No...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Tienes que enterrar tú esta
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}cápsula del tiempo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} por mí!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
¡Vale!
Ahora no

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich hab gerade was von meinen
Lieblingssachen in eine Zeitkapsel
gesteckt und sie zugemacht.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Jetzt müsste ich die Kapsel
eigentlich vergraben.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:000C:}}Aber dann
muss ich bestimmt heulen.
Bitte, mach du das!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Vergrab meine Zeitkapsel für mich!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Auf geht's!
Ich kann gerade nicht.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Az önce en kıymetli eşyamı
şu {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}zaman kapsülüne{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} koydum.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Şimdi bir tek gömmesi kaldı!
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Eşyamla vedalaşmak
düşündüğümden daha zormuş{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Onu çok özleyeceğim!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Umarım ağlamam.
Şu an moralim o kadar bozuk ki
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}zaman kapsülünü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} gömecek hâlim
yok.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Benim yerime sen yapmalısın!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Tamam!
Şimdi olmaz.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}De momento lleva la cápsula del
tiempo {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}con tus cartas.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Entiérrala{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
donde yo no la encuentre!
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Me sentaría muy mal que la
abrieras, así que no lo hagas,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Range-la avec tes lettres, et va
l'enterrer où tu le souhaites,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Et surtout, j'espère que tu ne
regarderas pas ce qu'elle contient,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ti ricordi della capsula del tempo
che ti avevo chiesto di seppellire?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Potresti ridarmela?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Mi sembra chiaro che tu non hai
alcuna intenzione di seppellirla,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
quindi lo faccio da me.

EN:
Did you just totally space on
burying the capsule, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Well,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I guess I'll just do it myself.

ES:
¿Se te ha pasado lo de enterrar
la cápsula, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Bueno,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
supongo que lo haré yo mismo.

FR:
Tu n'as pas encore enterré ma
capsule, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Bon, donne.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Je vais le faire moi-même alors.

DE:
Hast du etwa vergessen, meine
Zeitkapsel einzugraben, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Dann muss ich das selbst machen...

TRANSLATION:
Kapsülü gömmeyi tamamen mi
unuttun, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Neyse,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} galiba kendim yapacağım.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Hurra!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Das ist ja meine alte
Zeitkapsel!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Junge,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} das ist ja schon
ewig her!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Hä?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Warum ist die denn leer?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Warst du das etwa, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Ach Mensch!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Warum denn bloß?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Das finde ich echt doof von dir!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Puse {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
dentro?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:001A:}}Jolín, ¡pues se me había
olvidado completamente!
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}¡Y además hay una carta!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¿Cómo he podido olvidarme
también de eso?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Roba degna di un poeta!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Il mio vecchio io ci sapeva fare
con le parole.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I wanted to give you something,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} but
it looks like your pockets are full.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I'll just mail it to you,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Je voulais te donner quelque chose,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
mais tu es déjà très chargé{{TAG:000E:0006:000002006500}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Je te
le posterai plutôt,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sana bir şey vermek istiyordum,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ama ceplerin dolu görünüyor.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Postayla yollarım,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Es {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0100}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Ya te avisaré la próxima vez que
entierre una cápsula del tiempo.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Evvaiii!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Hai trovato la mia capsula
del tempo!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Beh, diamo un po' un'occhiatina!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Eveet!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Zaman kapsülümü
bulmuşsun!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hadi, içine bir bakalım!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Trovato!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Ti darò un regalino come
segno della mia riconoscenza!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tieni, è per te!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Ach ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Ich hab doch ein Geschenk,
als kleines Dankeschön.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Da, für dich.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}What were you thinking?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} You can't
open someone else's time capsule!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
It's against the rules.
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ugh,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} just give it to me then,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Mais pourquoi t'as fait ça ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Tu ne
peux pas ouvrir les capsules des
gens comme ça !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
On a pas le droit ! Ça se fait pas !
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}GRRrrr...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} donne-la-moi maintenant,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Ma cosa ti è saltato in mente?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Non
puoi aprire le capsule del tempo
altrui come ti pare e piace!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Va contro le regole.
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Sgrunt,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} dalla a me e basta,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Aklından ne geçiyordu?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Başkasının zaman kapsülü açılmaz!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Kurallara aykırı.
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Off,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} bari geri ver,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}What?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} This time capsule is empty!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}This time capsule isn't even really a
time capsule,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Pero qué pepinos...?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} La cápsula del
tiempo está abierta...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡¿y VACÍA?!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:000C:}}
¿Para qué me la traes, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?
